    "sampleCopy": {
      "title": "Marketing Content Samples & Templates",
      "backCoverBlurb": "When Andrew Keynes unearths a glittering object in the French countryside, he doesn’t realise he’s also uncovered the past—his, his country's, and one that refuses to stay buried. As the discovery threatens to unravel royal secrets and personal ones, Andrew must battle media hysteria, legal danger, and the echoes of his late daughter’s legacy. The Broken Crown is a richly woven tale of betrayal, introspection, and reclamation—of identity, integrity, and family. What would you risk to tell the truth?",
